    "created_at": "2016-10-20T07:01:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-20T07:01:55Z",
    "body": "Thank you for writing this patch! I noticed a couple of issues:\n- To link the term \"fire an event\" to its definition, one needs to write `<span data-x=\"concept-event-fire\">fire an event</span>`. You could change that around so that you only need to write `<span>fire an event</span>`, but then you'd have to update existing references and the `<dfn>`.\n- It seems like you did a case-insensitive search & replace. Sometimes \"Fire\" needs to be uppercase. And also, because you did that I suspect not everything is 100 column wrapped anywhere, per the description at https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#formatting.\n\nPlease do let me know if you have any questions.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
