    "body": "To build locally you need to follow the instructions here: https://github.com/whatwg/html-build. It's mentioned in the CONTRIBUTING document, but maybe not clearly enough?\n\nI think the issues I noted about around 100 column-line-length and \"Fire a simple event\" becoming \"fire an event\" instead of \"Fire an event\" are still there. So those would still need to be fixed before we can proceed.\n",
